# Build context for worker/Dockerfile is the REPOSITORY ROOT (see the comment on
# the COPY lines in worker/Dockerfile and on the `az acr build` call in
# scripts/deploy.ps1). Only worker/entrypoint.sh, worker/lib/* and
# config/sandbox-classes.json are ever copied into the image; everything below
# is excluded so the context uploaded to ACR stays small.
#
# THIS IS A PLAIN PREFIX DENY-LIST ON PURPOSE. scripts/validate.ps1 parses it and
# fails if any pattern here would exclude a path a Dockerfile COPY names, but it
# only understands plain paths -- it refuses to evaluate wildcard or re-include
# (`!`) patterns rather than guess. Adding one of those turns the gate off, so
# keep this file literal.
.git
.github
.squad
aspire
docs
scripts
templates
worker/tests
worker/images
config/image-evidence
